 157:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** /**
 158:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @brief  Perform a mass erase or erase the specified FLASH memory sectors
 159:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @param[in]  pEraseInit pointer to an FLASH_EraseInitTypeDef structure that
 160:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *         contains the configuration information for the erasing.
 161:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *
 162:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @param[out]  SectorError pointer to variable that contains the configuration
 163:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *          information on faulty sector in case of error (0xFFFFFFFF means that all
 164:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *          the sectors have been correctly erased).
 165:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *
 166:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @retval HAL Status
